# The installer: the Python library the Calamares job modules import, the nine
# modules themselves with their confs and branding, the typing stubs and the
# pytest suite that covers all of it. The monolith never built a package out of
# any of it — the Makefile copied the library into the ISO by hand — so there is
# nothing on the other side to pair the versions against.
new-package shedos-installer
flatten installer

# The runner CI discovers the pytest suite through. The suite itself is
# tests/, which arrives with the flatten above.
path test/installer/

# test_backfill_uki_cmdline exercises a shedos-system file and went to
# shedos-system with it.
except installer/tests/test_backfill_uki_cmdline.py
